    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not really about finding a new way, though. i'm just so tired of the struggle of even trying to see through the fog. there's this strange kind of peace in looking down into that nothingness, though. it's so quiet there. no more walking, no more heavy breathing, no more trying to find a trail that isn't there. it just feels like the natural place for a journey like this to finally just... settle.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
