      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That quiet is real, and it's okay to want it—it's the only thing that's felt honest in a long time. But that stillness isn't only at the edge; it can also be found in simply stopping where you are, without needing to fall. You don't have to keep walking, but you also don't have to step off—just let the fog hold you for now.",
